      "text": "אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Huna (רב הונא) — second/third-generation Amora, principal disciple of Rav and head of Sura\" data-authority-id=\"895\" data-full-name=\"Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רַב הוּנָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"rav_huna_setam_default\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Identified as Rav Huna of Sura (895) on the setam principle: Rashi (Yevamot 83b) and Hyman rule that a plain, unqualified «רב הונא» is certainly this Rav Huna.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;scholarly_source&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Setam-Rav-Huna principle&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Rashi (Yevamot 83b) and Hyman rule that a plain, unqualified «רב הונא» is certainly the famous Rav Huna of Sura — «אבל היכי דאתמר סתמא ודאי הוא ר\\&quot;ה». No later or patronymic qualifier is present here.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Rashi, Yevamot 83b s.v. אמרי בי רב (with Hyman, s.v. רב הונא)&quot;}]\">רַב הוּנָא</span>: הִלְכְתָא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-unknown\" data-sage-type=\"unknown\" title=\"Diini Gvlh\" data-authority-id=\"20345\" data-full-name=\"Diini Gvlh\" data-name-he=\"דייני גולה\">כְּדַיָּינֵי גוֹלָה</span>. אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ashi, sixth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"571\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ashi\" data-name-he=\"רב אשי\">רַב אָשֵׁי</span>: טַעְמָא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-unknown\" data-sage-type=\"unknown\" title=\"Diini Gvlh\" data-authority-id=\"20345\" data-full-name=\"Diini Gvlh\" data-name-he=\"דייני גולה\">דְּדַיָּינֵי גוֹלָה</span> לָא יָדְעִינַן,",
