      "width": "655px",
      "text": "הִלְכְתָא עָבְדִינַן כְּווֹתַיְיהוּ?! <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"400\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"389\" data-sentence-id=\"5\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><big><strong>מַתְנִי׳</strong></big> <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>הָאוֹמֵר לַחֲבֵירוֹ: ״חֲצִי שָׂדֶה אֲנִי מוֹכֵר לָךְ״ –",
