      "text": "וְנוֹטֵל חֶצְיָהּ בַּדָּרוֹם. וְהוּא מְקַבֵּל עָלָיו מְקוֹם הַגָּדֵר, חָרִיץ וּבֶן חָרִיץ. וְכַמָּה הוּא",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "חָרִיץ? שִׁשָּׁה טְפָחִים. וּבֶן חָרִיץ – שְׁלֹשָׁה<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"401\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"390\" data-sentence-id=\"6\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"ב\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"6\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><big><strong>גְּמָ׳</strong></big> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Ḥiyya bar Abba, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1091\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Ḥiyya bar Abba\" data-name-he=\"רבי חייא בר אבא\">רַבִּי חִיָּיא בַּר אַבָּא</span> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1570\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan II\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן\">רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן</span>:",
